        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Rhys-Davies, Timothy Dalton, Samuel L. Jackson, Peter Berg, Damon Wayans, Jeff Goldblum, Jon Lovitz, Cheech Marin, Salli Richardson, Jamie Foxx\n- Products: The Untouchables, Shōgun, Sliders, Robin of Sherwood, The Living Daylights, I, Claudius, The Great White Hype, James Bond film series\n- Roles: Agent Michael Malone, Pilot Vasco Rodrigues, Professor Maximillian Arturo, King Richard I, General Leonid Pushkin, Macro, James Bond\n\nFacts:\n- In 1976, John Rhys-Davies played Macro in the television series \"I, Claudius.\"\n- In 1980, John Rhys-Davies played Pilot Vasco Rodrigues in the miniseries \"Shōgun.\"\n- In 1984, John Rhys-Davies played King Richard I in \"Robin of Sherwood.\"\n- In 1987, \"The Living Daylights\" was the fifteenth film in the \"James Bond\" film series and the first to star Timothy Dalton as James Bond.\n- In 1987, John Rhys-Davies played General Leonid Pushkin in the James Bond film \"The Living Daylights.\"\n- In 1993, John Rhys-Davies played Agent Michael Malone in the remake of the 1950s television series \"The Untouchables.\"\n- In 1995, John Rhys-Davies played Professor Maximillian Arturo in \"Sliders.\"\n- \"The Great White Hype\" stars Samuel L. Jackson, Peter Berg, Damon Wayans, Jeff Goldblum, Jon Lovitz, Cheech Marin, John Rhys-Davies, Salli Richardson, and Jamie Foxx.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
